# Environment backups. `.env` itself is ignored above, but a copy taken before a
# migration is not, and it carries the same credentials. One was created on
# 2026-09-08 when the app moved from MySQL to PostgreSQL.
.env.backup-*
.env.*.backup
*.env.bak
